                            <comment id="14727457" author="moon" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 14:54:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Can you try either, without &apos;clean&apos; in your maven command&lt;br/&gt;
or remove maven-clean-plugin plugin from spark-dependencies/pom.xml file? &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/spark-dependencies/pom.xml#L692&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/spark-dependencies/pom.xml#L692&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727589" author="kupferk" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 16:32:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I have the same problem, that I cannot start Zeppelin any more. I get the very same exception. If I go back in the git history to the commit just before &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-160&quot; title=&quot;Create spark-provided profile in zeppelin/spark&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-160&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-160&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, it works. Maybe the problem is related to the fact that I do not have a system-wide Scala installation on my system.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727606" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 16:45:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Leemoonsoo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-276&quot; title=&quot;Can not start zeppelin-deamon.sh on master&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-276&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-276&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Can not start zeppelin-deamon.sh on master&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This patch providing fix for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-276&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-276&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    The reason was spark/pom.xml has maven-clean-plugin that clear interpreter/spark directory in maven &apos;clean&apos; lifecycle. which results cleaning the directory interpreter/spark/dep created by spark-dependencies submodule, which directory supposed to have spark binaries.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/Leemoonsoo/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-276&quot; title=&quot;Can not start zeppelin-deamon.sh on master&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-276&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-276&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #274&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit c4ca731f4712a41dea88e985b015bf6238e5b7b6&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Lee moon soo &amp;lt;moon@apache.org&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2015-09-02T16:42:28Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Remove maven-clean-plugin from spark/pom.xml and spark-dependencies/pom.xml&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14727616" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 2 Sep 2015 16:49:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274#issuecomment-137166759&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/274#issuecomment-137166759&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Merging it quickly, as it provides hot fix for &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-276&quot; title=&quot;Can not start zeppelin-deamon.sh on master&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-276&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-276&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, that breaks zeppelin working from guided build command &quot;mvn clean package&quot;, in master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
